'Example 02 - Axial tension rod check
'No gh_/ghc_ prefix: intended for the BASIC or SELECTIVE workflow
'(Load CPD -> Play CPD -> Export/Save, or with explicit Filter Names
'typed by hand in Search Variables / Search Results).

N = 50kN'design axial tensile force
d = 20mm'rod diameter
fy = 235MPa'steel yield strength (S235)
gammaM0 = 1'partial safety factor for resistance

A = pi*(d/2)^2'gross cross-sectional area
NRd = A*fy/gammaM0'design tensile resistance
util = N/NRd'utilization ratio - should stay <= 1
